    "preamble": "P.Palanichamy vs The Commissioner on 28 February, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P. In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 28.02.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No. 4802 of 2024 P.Palanichamy .... Pet Vs 1. The Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Dms Campus, Anna Salai, Chennai 600 006. 2. The Designated Officer, Ariyalur District Food Safety Office, Ariyalur District. .... Res Prayer : Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of the Constituti India praying to issue a Writ of Mandamus, directing the first resp to pass appropriate orders on the representation of the petitioner submitted on 01.10.2022 and 02.02.2024 for sanction of full additio charge allowance for the period as mentioned in para 3 above, withi reasonable period as may be fixed by this Court. For Petitioner : Mr.T.Ranganathan For Respondents : Mr.V.Veluchamy Additional Government Pleader https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/5 W.P Order P.Palanichamy vs The Commissioner on 28 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/165779432/ 1",
